  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button (Salva plate)",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Reversed band plate for the single primary action; inverts to light ink at night.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg>Salva intervento</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:54px;padding:0 24px;min-width:260px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--primario-fondo,#15130f);color:var(--primario-testo,#f4f1ea);border:1.5px solid var(--primario-fondo,#15130f);font:700 1.0625rem/1.2 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;transition:background-color .15s,transform .1s}.ds-btn-primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.15)}.ds-btn-primary:active{transform:scale(.98)}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid var(--inchiostro,#17140f);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Paper plate with a strong-rule outline for secondary actions (Svuota, export).",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn\">Svuota</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:48px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--carta,#fbfaf7);border:1.5px solid var(--linea-forte,#8f877a);color:var(--inchiostro,#17140f);font:700 .9375rem/1.2 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;transition:background-color .15s,transform .1s}.ds-btn:hover{background:var(--stock-2,#e3e0d7)}.ds-btn:active{transform:scale(.98)}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid var(--inchiostro,#17140f);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Light, outlined field under a printed uppercase label.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span class=\"ds-label\">Missione</span><input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"04AA0000\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:block;max-width:320px}.ds-label{display:block;margin:0 0 5px;font:700 .75rem/1.4 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--inchiostro-2,#4d473b)}.ds-input{width:100%;height:48px;padding:0 12px;background:var(--carta,#fbfaf7);border:1.5px solid var(--linea,#cbc5b7);border-radius:8px;font:400 1.0625rem -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--inchiostro,#17140f);box-sizing:border-box}.ds-input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--inchiostro,#17140f);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--inchiostro,#17140f)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Choice Chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip",
      "description": "Filled, borderless choice chips; the selected one takes the band. On phones three shortcuts plus an inline Altro select.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\">3030</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">5022</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">3040</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Altro…</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-chip{min-height:44px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--chip-fondo,#dedad0);border:1.5px solid transparent;color:var(--inchiostro,#17140f);font:600 .9375rem/1.15 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),color .15s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-chip:hover{background:var(--chip-fondo-hover,#d4cfc3)}.ds-chip[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--banda,#15130f);border-color:var(--banda,#15130f);color:var(--banda-testo,#f4f1ea)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid var(--inchiostro,#17140f);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tear-off Code Strip",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "striscia-giallo",
      "description": "Signature: perforated colour strips; the chosen code stays full with its word, the others tear off to a dashed outline.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-strappo\"><button class=\"ds-striscia ds-v\" aria-checked=\"false\">Verde</button><button class=\"ds-striscia ds-g\" aria-checked=\"true\">✓ Giallo</button><button class=\"ds-striscia ds-r\" aria-checked=\"false\">Rosso</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-strappo{display:flex;max-width:360px}.ds-striscia{flex:1 1 0;min-height:58px;border:2px solid var(--c);background:var(--c);color:var(--ct);font:800 .9375rem -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .24s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),color .22s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-striscia+.ds-striscia{border-left-width:0}.ds-striscia:first-child{border-radius:8px 0 0 8px}.ds-striscia:last-child{border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}.ds-v{--c:var(--verde,#1b7a3e);--ct:#fff;--cs:var(--verde-strappo,#1b7a3e)}.ds-g{--c:var(--giallo,#f2c230);--ct:var(--giallo-testo,#1d1705);--cs:var(--giallo-strappo,#765600)}.ds-r{--c:var(--rosso,#c8201e);--ct:#fff;--cs:var(--rosso-strappo,#b01c1a)}.ds-striscia[aria-checked=\"false\"]{background:transparent;border-style:dashed;color:var(--cs)}.ds-striscia[aria-checked=\"true\"]{box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgb(0 0 0 / .18);position:relative;z-index:2}.ds-striscia:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid var(--inchiostro,#17140f);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mini Strip (invio → rientro)",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "mini-strappo-rientro",
      "description": "Invio light (tint plus inset border), rientro full, joined by a perforation.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-mini\"><span class=\"ds-seg ds-inv\">Giallo</span><span class=\"ds-seg ds-rie\">Rosso</span></span>",
      "css": ".ds-mini{display:inline-flex;white-space:nowrap}.ds-seg{position:relative;padding:4px 7px 3px;min-width:3.2em;text-align:center;font:800 .6875rem/1.2 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}.ds-inv{--c:var(--giallo,#f2c230);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c) 30%,var(--stock,#eeece6));color:var(--inchiostro,#17140f);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--c);border-radius:4px 0 0 4px}.ds-rie{background:var(--rosso,#c8201e);color:#fff;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0}.ds-rie::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:-1px;top:2px;bottom:2px;width:2px;background-image:linear-gradient(var(--stock,#eeece6) 55%,transparent 0);background-size:2px 4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Band and Tab Bar",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "scheda",
      "description": "The black band shell: header on top, four uppercase tabs at the bottom on phones.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-schede\"><a class=\"ds-scheda\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg>Inserisci</a><a class=\"ds-scheda\" href=\"#\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 6h11M9 12h11M9 18h11M4 6h.01M4 12h.01M4 18h.01\"/></svg>Elenco</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-schede{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);background:var(--banda,#15130f);max-width:360px}.ds-scheda{height:58px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:3px;position:relative;color:var(--banda-testo-2,#b4ad9f);text-decoration:none;font:700 .6875rem -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}.ds-scheda:hover{color:var(--banda-testo,#f4f1ea)}.ds-scheda[aria-current=\"page\"]{color:var(--banda-testo,#f4f1ea)}.ds-scheda[aria-current=\"page\"]::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:0;left:28%;right:28%;height:3px;background:var(--banda-testo,#f4f1ea);border-radius:0 0 2px 2px}.ds-scheda:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid var(--banda-testo,#f4f1ea);outline-offset:-4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "KPI Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "cod",
      "description": "KPIs on the stock, no cards: dashed top perforation, hairline splits, tabular numerals.",
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-kpi\"><div><dt>Interventi</dt><dd class=\"ds-val\">90</dd><dd class=\"ds-nota\">86 valutati</dd></div><div><dt>Rossi al rientro</dt><dd class=\"ds-val\">22 <span class=\"ds-cod\">Rosso</span></dd><dd class=\"ds-nota\">26% dei valutati</dd></div></dl>",
      "css": ".ds-kpi{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1px;margin:0;background:var(--linea,#cbc5b7) padding-box;border-top:2px dashed var(--linea,#cbc5b7);max-width:420px}.ds-kpi>div{background:var(--stock,#eeece6);padding:12px 12px 14px}.ds-kpi dt{font:800 .6875rem -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--inchiostro-2,#4d473b)}.ds-kpi dd{margin:0}.ds-val{font:800 2rem/1.1 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--inchiostro,#17140f)}.ds-nota{font-size:.8125rem;color:var(--inchiostro-2,#4d473b)}.ds-cod{display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;padding:3px 6px 2px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--rosso,#c8201e);color:#fff;font:800 .625rem/1.2 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Triage Tag",
    "overview": "**Creative North Star: \"The Triage Tag\"**\n\nEvery record is a printed triage tag. The ground is tag stock: a warm, slightly yellowed card by day (stock) and a warm charcoal at night (stock-notte). The tag's black band is the app shell: the header and the tab bar (a left rail on screens) are one solid band of near-black ink. On that stock, the four START colours VERDE, GIALLO, ROSSO and NERO are the only saturated colours that carry meaning, and each always appears with its word printed on it. The colour code is the fastest thing to set and the first thing read back.\n\nThe world is dense and practical. Labels are bold, uppercase, tracked system sans, like the printed field names on a tag; times, ages, mission codes and every statistic use tabular numerals. The one ornament is the perforation: dashed rules that separate the tag's sections and the joints of the code strips. There are no cards, no illustrations and no decorative colour. It replaces the generic white medical form with one blue accent and rounded cards.\n\nNight is a first-class mode, not an inversion afterthought: the stock darkens, primary plates flip to light ink on dark, and code colours shift to brighter, legible tear-off tones.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm tag stock ground, black band shell, no neutral grey.",
      "Four START colours as the only meaningful saturated colours, always with their word.",
      "Bold uppercase tracked labels; tabular numerals for every number.",
      "Dashed perforations as the only ornament and the main separator.",
      "The tear-off code strip as the signature, at full size in the form and in miniature everywhere else."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Word With The Colour Rule",
        "body": "A START colour never appears without its word (VERDE, GIALLO, ROSSO, NERO) printed on or beside it. Charts that use the colours label each bar with the code name.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Four Colours Only Rule",
        "body": "VERDE, GIALLO, ROSSO and NERO are the only saturated colours that carry meaning. Everything else is tinted from the stock or the band; never introduce a brand accent or a neutral grey.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Chiaro Invio, Pieno Rientro Rule",
        "body": "Wherever invio and rientro appear together, invio is light (a tint of its colour) and rientro is full colour. This holds in the mini strip and in every invio/rientro chart.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tabular Rule",
        "body": "Every time, date, age, mission code, count and percentage uses tabular numerals so columns of tags line up.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Printed Field Rule",
